physicalRef: claim_party/database
description: "Insurance-claims Link Analysis showcase - One row per person on a claim (role driver, passenger or claimant) with the person details as written on that claim: name, date of birth, phone, address. Placeholders (blank, 0000000000, UNKNOWN) are real data-quality noise. Landed by the claim_party Pipeline. Synthetic."
